                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "08eeff88-7fc2-3112-b0c4-73571b2a81bf",
                        "entry_id": "afb9bd19-fa05-3e5a-a109-46d644409a54",
                        "glosses": [
                            "trait, habit, manner"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e272e205-742f-4799-840b-3c923a1cfcf8",
                                "sense_id": "08eeff88-7fc2-3112-b0c4-73571b2a81bf",
                                "text": "Лицо́ бы́ло вы́брито, по-чино́вничьи, но давно́ уже́, так что уже́ гу́сто начала́ выступа́ть си́зая щети́на. Да и в ухва́тках его́ действи́тельно бы́ло что́-то соли́дно-чино́вничье.",
                                "translation": "Like a clerk, he wore no beard, nor moustache, but had been so long unshaven that his chin looked like a stiff greyish brush. And there was something respectable and like an official about his manner too.",
                                "english": "Like a clerk, he wore no beard, nor moustache, but had been so long unshaven that his chin looked like a stiff greyish brush. And there was something respectable and like an official about his manner too."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5265aefa-1517-42d3-862d-a069d0cad300",
                                "sense_id": "08eeff88-7fc2-3112-b0c4-73571b2a81bf",
                                "text": "Ю́лия Гудаевская, стра́стная, жесто́ко-сентимента́льная дли́нная, то́нкая, суха́я, стра́нно — при несхо́дстве фигу́р — походи́ла на му́жа ухва́тками: таки́е же поры́вистые движе́ния, така́я же соверше́нная несоразме́рность с движе́ниями други́х.",
                                "translation": "Julia Goudayevskaya was a tall, slim, bony woman, passionate and extremely sentimental, who, in spite of the disparity of their figures, resembled her husband in certain habits : she had the same impetuous and disproportionate movements, unlike those of other people.",
                                "english": "Julia Goudayevskaya was a tall, slim, bony woman, passionate and extremely sentimental, who, in spite of the disparity of their figures, resembled her husband in certain habits : she had the same impetuous and disproportionate movements, unlike those of other people."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fd2227e7-38f2-3152-842e-0f2da2ca7372",
                        "entry_id": "afb9bd19-fa05-3e5a-a109-46d644409a54",
                        "glosses": [
                            "skill, proficiency, dexterity"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e7a3de3-cfd6-44f6-a00d-a85e7d608d59",
                                "sense_id": "fd2227e7-38f2-3152-842e-0f2da2ca7372",
                                "text": "С двена́дцати лет уж он паха́л и вози́л. Си́лы не́ было, а ухва́тка была́.",
                                "translation": "And at twelve years of age he had already begun to plough and to drive the cart. The skill was there though the strength was not.",
                                "english": "And at twelve years of age he had already begun to plough and to drive the cart. The skill was there though the strength was not."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
